{"seq":2,"slug":"computer-applications","title":"计算机应用","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications","introMarkdown":"# 计算机应用 简介\n\n计算机应用专业（专业代码：710201）是中等职业教育中覆盖面最广、就业口径最宽的信息技术类专业之一。本专业面向初中毕业生，学制三年，旨在培养具备计算机硬件维护、办公自动化操作、网络搭建管理以及基础编程能力的复合型技术技能人才。\n\n毕业生主要从事计算机操作员、计算机维修工、网络管理员、办公文秘、数据录入与处理等岗位工作，也可通过\"1+X\"职业技能等级证书（如 Web 前端开发、网络系统建设与运维、计算机程序设计）拓展发展空间，或升入高职院校继续深造。\n\n本专业教学内容分为四个核心模块：\n\n**第一章 硬件维护** 从计算机硬件组成讲起，覆盖整机组装流程、操作系统安装配置、常见硬件故障诊断与排除，使学生具备独立完成设备部署与维修的实操能力。\n\n**第二章 办公自动化** 聚焦职场必备的文档排版、电子表格数据处理、演示文稿制作三大技能，融入 AI 辅助创作工具的运用，帮助学生快速胜任行政办公与数据分析岗位。\n\n**第三章 网络基础** 系统介绍计算机网络原理、局域网搭建与管理、网络安全防护知识，培养学生组建和维护中小型网络环境的实际能力。\n\n**第四章 编程与数据库** 引导学生建立算法思维，通过 Python 编程、MySQL 数据库操作和 Web 前端开发三个方向的实训，打通从逻辑设计到应用交付的全链路技能。\n\n建议学习路径：先掌握硬件基础和操作系统知识（第一章），再熟练办公软件操作（第二章），接着理解网络通信原理与安全规范（第三章），最后进入编程与数据库的综合实训（第四章）。四个模块由浅入深、前后衔接，每个阶段均配合大量动手练习，确保学以致用。\n\n在 2026 年数字经济加速发展的背景下，本专业特别强化了数字素养、AI 工具应用、云计算基础和网络安全意识等前沿内容，使学生既能适应传统 IT 运维岗位，也能跟上技术迭代的步伐。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hardware-maintenance","title":"硬件维护","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"computer-architecture-assembly","title":"计算机组成与装配","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance/computer-architecture-assembly"},{"seq":2,"slug":"operating-system-management","title":"操作系统管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance/operating-system-management"},{"seq":3,"slug":"hardware-troubleshooting","title":"硬件故障排除","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/hardware-maintenance/hardware-troubleshooting"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"office-automation","title":"办公自动化","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/office-automation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"document-processing","title":"文档处理技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/office-automation/document-processing"},{"seq":2,"slug":"spreadsheet-data-analysis","title":"电子表格与数据分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/office-automation/spreadsheet-data-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"presentation-multimedia","title":"演示与多媒体制作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/office-automation/presentation-multimedia"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"network-fundamentals","title":"网络基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/network-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"network-basics-topology","title":"网络基础与拓扑","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/network-fundamentals/network-basics-topology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"network-setup-administration","title":"网络搭建与管理","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/network-fundamentals/network-setup-administration"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cybersecurity-basics","title":"网络安全基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/network-fundamentals/cybersecurity-basics"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"programming-database","title":"编程与数据库","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"programming-logic-python","title":"编程逻辑与 Python","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/programming-logic-python"},{"seq":2,"slug":"database-design-sql","title":"数据库设计与 SQL","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/database-design-sql"},{"seq":3,"slug":"web-frontend-basics","title":"Web 前端基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/secondary-vocational/computer-applications/programming-database/web-frontend-basics"}]}]}